n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -1 & -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -1 & -5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -1 & -5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}-{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+3{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -23 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14051562/state.json" "file_sha256" "ffe3c3ea924c9090a0ef060024cd7647323adf2f0b7035a8b390eb9aa3198283" "basis" 1763 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14051562/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-131620" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14051562/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9958fa4bc00ff5ea6ed702e7dadb7e8230ab2d70104c0323f70f1dc2748d9698" "basis" 1763 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14051562/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-131620" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/re